  "body": "Single-level homes are always in demand, and this brand-new single-level home offers an easy, low-maintenance option in a convenient Orewa location, with the added bonus of facing the reserve. With three bedrooms and a practical layout, it’s a great choice for first-home buyers, downsizers, investors or anyone looking for a home that’s\r\ncomfortable and easy to look after.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Modern open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n\r\n• Master bedroom with ensuite and direct access to the outdoor living area\r\n\r\n• Private, easy-care outdoor living area, perfect for relaxing\r\n\r\n• Internal-access single garage plus 1 off-street parking space\r\n\r\n• Low-maintenance design, ideal for an easy lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n\r\nSet within the growing Strathmill community, the location makes everyday life easy. Motorway access is close by, while Orewa Beach, cafés, schools, shops and restaurants are all just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nThis is a great opportunity to secure a brand-new single-level home in a location that offers both convenience and lifestyle. Contact us today for more information.\r\n\r\nHow to find Awa Uru Road:\r\nFollow West Hoe Heights until you see the Strathmill sign. Turn left onto Awa Uru Road and follow the signs.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
